<!--
  Chapter 55 — Helm, Kustomize & Environment Promotion.
    promotion/  ImageRef (repository, tag, digest) and PromotionPolicy: outside dev every image pinned by digest,
                production runs exactly what staging tested, and the pipeline's one edit to an overlay
    resources/  helm/foodfleet-service (one chart, values per environment, config checksum annotation, a guard
                against unpinned images) and kustomize/ (base plus dev, staging and prod overlays, a hashed
                configMapGenerator)
  verify/run.sh deploys menu-service with both on a real Kubernetes cluster (k3s 1.37) pulling from a local registry:
  render and validate, field ownership on re-apply, config rollouts, a failing release, and tags moved under pods.
-->
